---
title: Recipes
layout: base.njk
---
<div class="page-head"><h1>Recipes</h1></div>
<p class="recipes-intro">Hello, and welcome to my collection of recipes! I was born and raised in Minnesota, USA, and I am Costa Rican American. This collection includes recipes I grew up with as well as recipes I have picked up over the years.</p>
{% for cat in ['Appetizers', 'Breakfast', 'Entrees', 'Desserts'] %}
{% set rs = collections.recipes | inCategory(cat) %}
<section class="category">
    <h2>{{ cat }}</h2>
    {% if rs.length %}<ul>{% for r in rs %}<li><a href="{{ r.url }}">{{ r.data.title }}</a>{% if r.data.draft %}<span class="pencil">draft</span>{% endif %}</li>{% endfor %}</ul>
    {% else %}<p class="pencil">nothing here yet</p>{% endif %}
</section>
{% endfor %}
